---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Doc title="Privacy" description="What this website does and doesn’t do with your data." path="legal\privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Martin Pring, Real Logic AB, Sweden. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>

  <h2>No tracking</h2>
  <p>This site uses no analytics, no advertising and no tracking cookies. Nothing you do here is sent to me.</p>

  <h2>Stored in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    Two small preferences are kept locally in your browser and never leave it: whether sounds are on, and whether
    you’ve already seen the loading counter this session. Clear your site data to remove them.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub processes technical data such as your IP address to deliver the pages
    and keep the service secure. See GitHub’s own privacy statement for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>Fonts are served from this site, not from a third party.</p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>If you email me, I use your message only to reply and keep it no longer than needed for that.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the GDPR you can ask what personal data I hold about you, and have it corrected or deleted. You can also
    complain to the Swedish Authority for Privacy Protection (IMY).
  </p>
</Doc>
